        "created_at": "2014-01-11T01:06:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I had Visionary against Voss. Visionary had previously played a Decoy Projection that had 2 HP left when a Forced Deployment came up. She proceeded to Brain Burn the villain trash (13 cards), redirecting the damage to the Projection. I assumed that all 13 damage went to the Projection, massively overkilling it and saving Visionary. Did I play wrong?</p>",
