        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-11T01:10:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You did it correctly.&nbsp; The damage is dealt at once, not one point at a time.&nbsp; The decoy would be at -11 HP after Brain Burn resolved and would be destroyed.</p>",
