      {
        "id": 86453,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-11T02:03:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oops, I've been doing that wrong, then - I should know better, really, after all this time, lol. Say my Decoy has 3hp left and gets hit for five points of damage, I'll take 3hp off the Decoy which kills it, so then Visionary takes the final 2hp. So basically I've been completely forgetting the \"stuff can go into negative hp\" thing that I remember for <span class=\"bbcode-i\">everything else in the game</span>, lol. Not that I play Visionary that often, and when I do I rarely get a Decoy out anyway, so it's not something that's ever really come up.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:10:27.021Z",
