        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Oops, I&#39;ve been doing that wrong, then - I should know better, really, after all this time, lol. Say my Decoy has 3hp left and gets hit for five points of damage, I&#39;ll take 3hp off the Decoy which kills it, so then Visionary takes the final 2hp. So basically I&#39;ve been completely forgetting the &quot;stuff can go into negative hp&quot; thing that I remember for [i]everything else in the game[/i], lol. Not that I play Visionary that often, and when I do I rarely get a Decoy out anyway, so it&#39;s not something that&#39;s ever really come up.\n",
